---
description: Use agent-skills workflows from .cursor/skills
alwaysApply: true
---

Before non-trivial technical work:

1. Route via `.cursor/skills/using-agent-skills/SKILL.md`.
2. Read and follow the matching skill under `.cursor/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`.
3. Open `reference.md` or `references/` in that folder when the skill links to them.
4. Prefer project skills over guessing; the user does not need to say "read skill" each time.

For real-browser interaction (click/type/navigate, logged-in sessions, JS-rendered or bot-protected pages), use `.cursor/skills/browser-harness/SKILL.md` and its `install.md`. Prefer `curl`/fetch for plain public HTTP.

Upstream:
- https://github.com/addyosmani/agent-skills
- https://github.com/browser-use/browser-harness
